@startuml
participant "Motion tools" as MT
participant "Joulefish" as JF
participant "LLM" as LLM
database "simple_summary" as SS

MT -> JF: sends motiontext
JF -> LLM: requests desired output
LLM --> JF: simplified motion returns
JF -> MT: verifies motion summary and sends it to motion tools
MT -> SS: writes into new field
@endumlpl